# Folder and naming conventions

## Layout (`frontend/src`)

| Folder | Use for |
|--------|---------|
| `api/` | Query keys, fetchers, API types |
| `hooks/` | React hooks, including Query wrappers |
| `stores/` | Zustand stores |
| `components/` | Shared UI; `components/ui/` = ShadCN primitives (keep generator names) |
| `pages/` | Route screens (`*Page.tsx`) |
| Feature dirs (e.g. `dashboard/`) | Feature-specific modules |
| `lib/` | Shared helpers (`queryClient`, `utils`) |
| `test/` | Vitest setup only |

## Naming (TypeScript / React)

- **Components & pages:** PascalCase files matching the export (`TimeRangePicker.tsx`, `DashboardPage.tsx`).
- **Hooks:** camelCase with `use` prefix (`useBtcPriceHistoryQuery.ts`, `useCreateExampleItemMutation.ts`).
- **Modules** (api, stores, lib, utils): camelCase (`btcPriceHistory.ts`, `preferencesStore.ts`, `queryClient.ts`).
- One primary export per file; component export name matches the file name.
- Tests: co-located `*.test.ts(x)`; helpers: `*.testHelpers.ts(x)`.
- Prefer TypeScript-style names above; do not introduce kebab-case app modules.
- Exception: leave `components/ui/*` as ShadCN generates them.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — kebab-case or folder-per-component noise
src/components/time-range-picker.tsx
src/hooks/use-btc-price-history-query.ts
src/components/TimeRangePicker/index.tsx

// ✅ GOOD — TypeScript-style file names
src/components/TimeRangePicker.tsx
src/hooks/useBtcPriceHistoryQuery.ts
src/api/btcPriceHistory.ts
src/stores/preferencesStore.ts
```
